# Vercel CLI upload exclusions for the separate ForgeVCS project.
#
# The Docker build needs Cargo.toml, Cargo.lock, rust-toolchain.toml, crates/, upstream/,
# acl.toml and Dockerfile.vercel. Everything here is local-only: history, build output,
# credentials, docs and operator scripts. `.dockerignore` separately keeps the same paths
# out of the container build context.
.git
.vercel
.neon
target
upstream/target
docs
scripts
.env
.env.*
node_modules
*.log
